@startuml

title Communication Protocol Comparison

!include ../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/package-diagram-style.iuml

package "REST / HTTP" {
    rectangle "HTTP/1.1 or HTTP/2" as HTTP $fill_primary
}
note right of HTTP
  Text-based (JSON/XML)
  Widely supported, Cacheable
  Stateless, Human readable
  <b>Best for:</b> Public APIs
end note

package "gRPC" {
    rectangle "HTTP/2 + Protobuf" as GRPC $fill_ok
}
note right of GRPC
  Binary format, Strong typing
  Bidirectional streaming
  Code generation
  <b>Best for:</b> Internal services
end note

package "GraphQL" {
    rectangle "Query Language" as GQL $fill_caution
}
note right of GQL
  Client specifies data
  Single round trip
  Typed schema
  <b>Best for:</b> Complex data needs
end note

package "WebSocket" {
    rectangle "Full-Duplex Connection" as WS $fill_alt
}
note right of WS
  Real-time updates
  Server push, Low latency
  Bidirectional
  <b>Best for:</b> Live apps, chat
end note

HTTP -[hidden]d- GRPC
GRPC -[hidden]d- GQL
GQL -[hidden]d- WS

legend bottom
  | Protocol | Characteristics | Use Case |
  | REST | Text, cacheable, simple | Public APIs, web |
  | gRPC | Binary, streaming, fast | Microservices |
  | GraphQL | Flexible queries | Mobile, complex data |
  | WebSocket | Real-time, bidirectional | Live updates |
endlegend
@enduml
